    rdfs:label "Sitting"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Getting into and out of a seated position and changing body position from sitting down to any other position, such as standing up or lying down.

Inclusions: getting into a sitting position with bent legs or cross-legged; getting into a sitting position with feet supported or unsupported"""@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d410 .

ICF-:d420 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
