    rdfs:label "Caring for body parts"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Looking after those parts of the body, such as skin, face, teeth, scalp, nails and genitals, that require more than washing and drying.

Inclusions: caring for skin, teeth, hair, finger and toe nails, and nose

Exclusions: washing oneself (d510); toileting (d530)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Occuparsi di quelle parti del corpo, come la pelle, la faccia, i denti, il cuoio capelluto, le unghie e i genitali, che richiedono altre cure oltre il lavaggio e lÃ¢â‚¬â„¢asciugatura.

Inclusioni: curare la pelle, i denti, i capelli e i peli, le unghie delle mani e dei piedi

Esclusioni: lavarsi (d510); Bisogni corporali (d530)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Prendersi cura di singole parti del corpo"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:d5300 a ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d530,
        ICF-:d5300,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Regulating urination"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Coordinating and managing urination, such as by indicating need, getting into the proper position, choosing and getting to an appropriate place for urination, manipulating clothing before and after urination, and cleaning oneself after urination."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d530 .

ICF-:d5301 a ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d530,
        ICF-:d5301,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Regulating defecation"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Coordinating and managing defecation such as by indicating need, getting into the proper position, choosing and getting to an appropriate place for defecation, manipulating clothing before and after defecation, and cleaning oneself after defecation."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d530 .

ICF-:d5302 a ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d530,
        ICF-:d5302,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Menstrual care"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Coordinating, planning and caring for menstruation, such as by anticipating menstruation and using sanitary towels and napkins."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d530 .

ICF-:d550 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:d550,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Eating"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Carrying out the coordinated tasks and actions of eating food that has been served, bringing it to the mouth and consuming it in culturally acceptable ways, cutting or breaking food into pieces, opening bottles and cans, using eating implements, having meals, feasting or dining.

Exclusions: drinking (d560)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Eseguire i compiti e le azioni coordinati di mangiare il cibo che ÃƒÂ¨ stato servito, portarlo alla bocca e consumarlo in modi culturalmente accettabili, tagliare o spezzare il cibo in pezzi, aprire bottiglie e lattine, usare posate, consumare i pasti, banchettare.

Esclusione: bere (d560)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Mangiare"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:d560 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:d560,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Drinking"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Taking hold of a drink, bringing it to the mouth, and consuming the drink in culturally acceptable ways, mixing, stirring and pouring liquids for drinking, opening bottles and cans, drinking through a straw or drinking running water such as from a tap or a spring; feeding from the breast.

Exclusions: eating (d550)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Prendere una bevanda, portarla alla bocca e consumarla in modi culturalmente accettabili, mescolare, rimescolare e versare liquidi da bere, aprire bottiglie e lattine, bere dalla cannuccia o bere acqua corrente, come da un rubinetto o da una sorgente; allattare al seno.

Esclusione: mangiare (d550)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Bere"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:d610 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d610,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Acquiring a place to live"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Buying, renting, furnishing and arranging a room, house, apartment or other dwelling.

Inclusions: buying or renting a place to live and furnishing a place to live

Exclusions: acquisition of goods and services (d620); caring for household objects (d650)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Comprare, prendere in affitto, arredare e sistemare una casa, un appartamento o un altro alloggio.

Inclusioni: comprare o prendere in affitto un posto in cui vivere e arredarlo

Esclusioni: procurarsi beni e servizi (d620); prendersi cura degli oggetti della casa (d650)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Procurarsi un posto in cui vivere"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury .

ICF-:d620 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
