    rdfs:label "Economic self-sufficiency"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Having command over economic resources, from private or public sources, in order to ensure economical security for present and future needs.

Inclusions: personal economic resources and public economic entitlements"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Gestione delle risorse economiche provenienti da fonti private o pubbliche per garantirsi sicurezza economica in vista delle necessitÃƒ  presenti o future.

Inclusioni: risorse economiche personali e sussidi economici pubblici"""^^xsd:string ;
