        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Handling stress and other psychological demands"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Carrying out simple or complex and coordinated actions to manage and control the psychological demands required to carry out tasks demanding significant responsibilities and involving stress, distraction, or crises, such as driving a vehicle during heavy traffic or taking care of many children.

Inclusions: handling responsibilities; handling stress and crisis"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Eseguire azioni semplici o complesse e coordinate per gestire e controllare le richieste di tipo psicologico necessarie per eseguire compiti che comportano significative responsabilitÃƒ , stress, distrazioni e crisi, come guidare un veicolo nel traffico intenso o occuparsi di molti bambini.

Inclusioni: gestire le responsabilitÃƒ ; gestire lo stress e le crisi"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Gestire la tensione e altre richieste di tipo psicologico"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:d360 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:d360,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Using communication devices and techniques"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Using devices, techniques and other means for the purposes of communicating, such as calling a friend on the telephone.

Inclusions: using telecommunication devices, using writing machines and communication techniques"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Utilizzare strumenti, tecniche e altri mezzi per scopi comunicativi, come chiamare un amico al telefono.

Inclusioni: utilizzare strumenti di telecomunicazione, usare macchine per scrivere e tecniche di comunicazione"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Utilizzo di strumenti e tecniche di comunicazione"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss .

ICF-:d750 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:d750,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Informal social relationships"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Entering into relationships with others, such as casual relationships with people living in the same community or residence, or with co-workers, students, playmates, people with similar backgrounds or professions.

Inclusions: informal relationships with friends, neighbours, acquaintances, co-inhabitants and peers"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Entrare in relazione con altri, come le relazioni casuali con persone che vivono nella stessa comunitÃƒ  o residenza, o con colleghi di lavoro, studenti, compagni di gioco o persone dello stesso ambiente o professione.

Inclusioni: relazioni informali con amici, vicini di casa, conoscenti, coinquilini e pari"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Relazioni sociali informali"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss .

