    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b730 .

ICF-:b7306 a ICF-:b730,
        ICF-:b7306,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Power of all muscles of the body"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions related to the force generated by the contraction of all muscles and muscle groups of the body.
Inclusions: impairments such as akinetic mutism"""^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b730 .

ICF-:b735 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:b735,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Muscle tone functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions related to the tension present in the resting muscles and the resistance offered when trying to move the muscles passively.
Inclusions: functions associated with the tension of isolated muscles and muscle groups, muscles of one limb, one side of the body and the lower half of the body, muscles of all limbs, muscles of the trunk, and all muscles of the body, impairments such as hypotonia, hypertonia and muscle spasticity, myotonia and paramyotonia
Exclusions: muscle power functions (b730); muscle endurance functions (b740)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni correlate alla tensione presente nei muscoli a riposo e alla resistenza opposta quando si cerca di muovere i muscoli passivamente.

Inclusioni: funzioni correlate alla tensione di muscoli isolati e di gruppi di muscoli, dei muscoli di un arto, di un lato del corpo e della metÃƒ  inferiore del corpo, dei muscoli di tutti gli arti, dei muscoli del tronco e di tutti i muscoli del corpo; menomazioni come ipotonia, ipertonia e spasticitÃƒ  muscolare

Esclusioni: funzioni della forza muscolare (b730); funzioni della resistenza muscolare (b740)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni del tono muscolare"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:b7401 a ICF-:b740,
        ICF-:b7401,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Endurance of muscle groups"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions related to sustaining muscle contraction of isolated muscle groups for the required period of time.
Inclusions: impairments associated with monoparesis, monoplegia, hemiparesis and hemiplegia, paraparesis and paraplegia"""^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b740 .

ICF-:b755 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:b755,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Involuntary movement reaction functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions of involuntary contractions of large muscles or the whole body induced by body position, balance and threatening stimuli.
Inclusions: functions of postural reactions, righting reactions, body adjustment reactions, balance reactions, supporting reactions, defensive reactions
Exclusions: motor reflex functions (b750)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni delle contrazioni involontarie di grandi muscoli o di tutto il corpo indotte da stimoli della posizione del corpo, dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢equilibrio e di minaccia.

Inclusioni: funzioni delle reazioni posturali, di raddrizzamento, di adattamento del corpo, di equilibrio, di sostegno, di difesa

Esclusione: funzioni del riflesso motorio (b750)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni della reazione di movimento involontario"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:b7603 a ICF-:b760,
        ICF-:b7603,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Supportive functions of arm or leg"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Functions associated with control over and coordination of voluntary movements by placing weight either on the arms (elbows or hands) or on the legs (knees or feet)."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b760 .

ICF-:b770 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:b770,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gait pattern functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions of movement patterns associated with walking, running or other whole body movements.
Inclusions: walking patterns and running patterns; impairments such as spastic gait, hemiplegic gait, paraplegic gait, asymmetric gait, limping and stiff gait pattern
Exclusions: muscle power functions (b730); muscle tone functions (b735); control of voluntary movement functions (b760); involuntary movement functions (b765)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni di pattern di movimento associati al camminare, correre o ad altri movimenti di tutto il corpo.

Inclusioni: pattern della deambulazione e della corsa; menomazioni come pattern dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢andatura spastica, emiplegica, paraplegica, asimmetrica, zoppicante e rigida

Esclusione: funzioni della forza muscolare (b730); funzioni del tono muscolare (b735); funzioni di controllo del movimento volontario (b760); funzioni del movimento involontario (b765)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni del pattern dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢andatura"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:d170 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:d170,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Writing"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Using or producing symbols or language to convey information, such as producing a written record of events or ideas or drafting a letter.

Exclusions: learning to write (d145)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Utilizzare o produrre simboli o linguaggio per comunicare informazioni, come produrre una documentazione scritta di eventi o idee o scrivere una lettera.

Esclusione: imparare a scrivere (d145)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Scrittura"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions .

ICF-:d177 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:d177,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Making decisions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Making a choice among options, implementing the choice, and evaluating the effects of the choice, such as selecting and purchasing a specific item, or deciding to undertake and undertaking one task from among several tasks that need to be done.

Exclusions: thinking (d163); solving problems (d175)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Effettuare una scelta tra piÃƒÂ¹ opzioni, metterla in atto e valutarne le conseguenze, come scegliere e acquistare un prodotto specifico, o decidere di intraprendere un compito tra vari altri che devono essere svolti.

Esclusioni: pensiero (d163); risoluzione di problemi (d175)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Prendere decisioni"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:d2400 a ICF-:d240,
        ICF-:d2400,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Handling responsibilities"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Carrying out simple or complex and coordinated actions to manage the duties of task performance and to assess the requirements of these duties."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:d240 .

ICF-:d3300 a ICF-:d330,
        ICF-:d3300,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Producing meaningful sounds"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Using single words to label objects, persons or actions such as ball, mommy, bye-bye."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:d330 .

ICF-:d3301 a ICF-:d330,
        ICF-:d3301,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Producing simple spoken messages"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Using words to produce simple spoken messages such as single or few words or expressing a need (e.g. I want ...) or feeling (e.g., I like ...)."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:d330 .

ICF-:d3302 a ICF-:d330,
        ICF-:d3302,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Producing complex spoken messages"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Using words to produce complex spoken messages (complete sentences) such as giving an explanation or asking for directions."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:d330 .

ICF-:d355 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:d355,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Discussion"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Starting, sustaining and ending an examination of a matter, with arguments for or against, or debate carried out by means of spoken, written, sign or other forms of language, with one or more people one knows or who are strangers, in formal or casual settings.

Inclusions: discussion with one person or many people"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Avviare, mantenere e terminare lÃ¢â‚¬â„¢esame di una questione, fornendo argomenti a favore o contro, o un dibattito realizzato attraverso linguaggio verbale, scritto, dei segni o altre forme di linguaggio, con una o piÃƒÂ¹ persone conosciute o meno, in contesti formali o informali.

Inclusione: discussione con una o molte persone"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Discussione"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss .

ICF-:d4402 a ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d440,
        ICF-:d4402,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Manipulating"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Using fingers and hands to exert control over, direct or guide something, such as when handling coins or other small objects, such as scissors, shoe laces, pencils, chopsticks, knives and forks."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:d440,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions .

ICF-:d455 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:d455,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Moving around"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Moving the whole body from one place to another by means other than walking, such as climbing over a rock or running down a street, skipping, scampering, jumping, somersaulting or running around obstacles.

Inclusions: crawling, climbing, running, jogging, jumping, and swimming

Exclusions: transferring oneself (d420); walking (d450)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Trasferire tutto il corpo da un posto allÃ¢â‚¬â„¢altro con modalitÃƒ  diverse dal camminare, come arrampicarsi su una roccia o correre per la strada, saltellare, scorrazzare, saltare, fare capriole o correre attorno a ostacoli.

Inclusioni: strisciare, salire, correre, fare jogging, saltare e nuotare

Esclusioni: trasferirsi (d420); camminare (d450)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Spostarsi"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions .

ICF-:d720 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:d720,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Complex interpersonal interactions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Maintaining and managing interactions with other people, in a contextually and socially appropriate manner, such as by regulating emotions and impulses, controlling verbal and physical aggression, acting independently in social interactions, and acting in accordance with social rules and conventions, when for example playing, studying or working with others.

Inclusions: forming and terminating relationship; regulating behaviours within interactions; interacting according to social rules; and maintaining social space."""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Mantenere e gestire le interazioni con gli altri, in un modo contestualmente e socialmente adeguato, come nel regolare le emozioni e gli impulsi, controllare lÃ¢â‚¬â„¢aggressione verbale e fisica, agire in maniera indipendente nelle interazioni sociali e agire secondo i ruoli e le convenzioni sociali.

Inclusioni: formare e porre termine a relazioni; regolare i comportamenti nelle interazioni; interagire secondo le regole sociali; mantenere la distanza sociale"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Interazioni interpersonali complesse"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss .

ICF-:d865 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:d865,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Complex economic transactions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Engaging in any form of complex economic transaction that involves the exchange of capital or property, and the creation of profit or economic value, such as buying a business, factory, or equipment, maintaining a bank account, or trading in commodities."@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA "Impegnarsi in ogni forma di transazione economica complessa che implichi lo scambio di capitale o proprietÃƒ  e la creazione di profitto o valore economico, come acquistare unÃ¢â‚¬â„¢impresa, una fabbrica o apparecchiature, mantenere un conto in banca, commerciare in titoli."^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Transazioni economiche complesse"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation .

SkAb:Systems_Skills a owl:Class ;
    SkAb:ONet_definition "Developed capacities used to understand, monitor, and improve socio-technical systems"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf SkAb:Skills .

ICF-:b1144 a ICF-:b114,
        ICF-:b1144,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Orientation to space"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Mental functions that produce awareness of one's body in relation to the immediate physical space."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b114 .

ICF-:b122 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:b122,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Global psychosocial functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """General mental functions, as they develop over the life span, required to understand and constructively integrate the mental functions that lead to the formation of the personal skills needed to establish reciprocal social interactions, in terms of both meaning and purpose.
Inclusions: such as in autism"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni mentali generali, che si sviluppano nel corso della vita, richieste per capire e integrare in modo costruttivo le funzioni mentali che portano alla formazione delle abilitÃƒ  interpersonali necessarie per stabilire interazioni sociali reciproche, in termini sia di significato che di risultato.

Inclusione: come nellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢autismo"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni psicosociali globali"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions .

ICF-:b1261 a ICF-:b126,
        ICF-:b1261,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Agreeableness"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Mental functions that produce a personal disposition that is cooperative, amicable, and accomodating, as contrasted to being unfriendly, oppositional and defiant."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b126 .

ICF-:b130 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:b130,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Energy and drive functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """General mental functions of physiological and psychological mechanisms that cause the individual to move towards satisfy specific needs and general goals in a persistent manner.
Inclusions: functions of energy level, motivation, appetites, craving (including craving for substances that can be abused), and impulse control
Exclusions: consciousness functions (b110); temperament and personality functions (b126); sleep functions (b134); psychomotor functions (b147); emotional functions (b152)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni mentali generali dei meccanismi fisiologici e psicologici che  spingono lÃ¢â‚¬â„¢individuo a muoversi in modo persistente verso il soddisfacimento di bisogni specifici e il conseguimento di obiettivi generali.

Inclusioni: funzioni del livello di energia, motivazione, appetito, craving* (compreso craving per lÃ¢â‚¬â„¢assunzione di sostanze di cui si puÃƒÂ² fare abuso) e controllo degli impulsi

Esclusioni: funzioni della coscienza (b110); funzioni del temperamento e della personalitÃƒ  (b126); funzioni del sonno (b134); funzioni psicomotorie (b147); funzioni emozionali (b152)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢energia e delle pulsioni"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:b1400 a ICF-:b140,
        ICF-:b1400,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Sustaining attention"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Mental functions that produce concentration for the period of time required."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b140 .

ICF-:b1401 a ICF-:b140,
        ICF-:b1401,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Shifting attention"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Mental functions that permit refocusing concentration from one stimulus to another."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b140 .

ICF-:b1441 a ICF-:b144,
        ICF-:b1441,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Long-term memory"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Mental functions that produce a memory system permitting the long-term storage of information from short-term memory and both autobiographical memory for past events and semantic memory for language and facts."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b144 .

ICF-:b156 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:b156,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Perceptual functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Specific mental functions of recognizing and interpreting sensory stimuli.
Inclusions: functions of auditory, visual, olfactory, gustatory, tactile and visuospatial perception, such as in hallucination or illusion
Exclusions: consciousness functions (b110); orientation functions (b114); attention functions (b140); memory functions (b144); mental functions of language (b167); seeing and related functions (b210-b229), hearing and vestibular functions (b230-b249); additional sensory functions (b250-b279)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni mentali specifiche correlate alle componenti emozionali e affettive dei processi della mente.

Inclusioni: funzioni della appropriatezza dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢emozione, regolazione e gamma dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢emozione; affetto; tristezza, felicitÃƒ , amore, paura, rabbia, odio, tensione, ansietÃƒ , gioia, dolore; labilitÃƒ  dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢emozione; appiattimento dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢affetto

Esclusioni: funzioni del temperamento e della personalitÃƒ  (b126);
funzioni dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢energia e delle pulsioni (b130)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni emozionali"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury .

ICF-:b1565 a ICF-:b156,
        ICF-:b1565,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Visuospatial perception"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Mental function involved in distinguishing by sight the relative position of objects in the environment or in relation to oneself.
Exclusions: orientation to objects (b1143)"""^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b156 .

ICF-:b1646 a ICF-:b164,
        ICF-:b1646,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Problem Solving"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Mental functions of identifying, analysing, and integrating incongruent or conflicting information into a solution."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b164 .

ICF-:b176 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:b176,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Mental functions of sequencing complex movements"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Specific mental functions of sequencing and co-ordinating complex, purposeful movements.
Inclusions: impairements such as in ideation, ideomotor, dressing, oculomotor, speech apraxia
Exclusions: psychomotor functions (b147); higher-level cognitive functions (b164); Chapter 7 Neuromusculoskeletal and Movement Related Functions (b7)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni mentali specifiche del mettere in sequenza e coordinare movimenti complessi e finalizzati.

Inclusioni: menomazioni come nellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢aprassia ideatoria, ideomotoria, del vestirsi, oculomotoria e verbale

Esclusioni: funzioni psicomotorie (b147); funzioni cognitive di livello superiore (b164); Capitolo 7 Ã¢â‚¬â€œ Funzioni neuro-muscoloscheletriche e correlate al movimento"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzione mentale di sequenza dei movimenti complessi"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke .

ICF-:b2301 a ICF-:b230,
        ICF-:b2301,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Sound discrimination"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Sensory functions relating to sensing the presence of sound involving the differentiation of ground and binaural synthesis, separation and blending."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b230,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss .

ICF-:b280 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:b280,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Sensation of pain"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Sensation of unpleasant feeling indicating potential or actual damage to some body structure.
Inclusions: sensations of generalized or localized pain, in one or more body part, pain in a dermatome, stabbing pain, burning pain, dull pain, aching pain; impairments such as myalgia, analgesia and hyperalgesia"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Sensazione sgradevole indicante un potenziale o effettivo danno a qualche struttura corporea.

Inclusioni: sensazioni di dolore generalizzato o localizzato, in una o piÃƒÂ¹ parti del corpo, dolore in un dermatomo, dolore lancinante, dolore bruciante, dolore sordo, dolore persistente; menomazioni come mialgia, analgesia e iperalgesia"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Sensazione di dolore"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:b320 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:b320,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Articulation functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions of the production of speech sounds.
Inclusions: functions of enunciation, articulation of phonemes; spastic, ataxic, flaccid dysarthria; anarthria
Exclusions: mental functions of language (b167); voice functions (b310)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni della produzione di suoni linguistici.

Inclusioni: funzioni di enunciazione, articolazione di fonemi; disartria spastica, atassica, flaccida; anartria

Esclusioni: funzioni mentali del linguaggio (b167); funzioni della voce (b310)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢articolazione della voce"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss .

ICF-:b330 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:b330,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Fluency and rhythm of speech functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions of the production of flow and tempo of speech.
Inclusions: functions of fluency, rhythm, speed and melody of speech; prosody and intonation; impairments such as stuttering, stammering, cluttering, bradylalia and tachylalia
Exclusions: mental functions of language (b167); voice functions (b310); articulation functions (b320)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni della produzione del flusso e del tempo dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢eloquio.

Inclusioni: funzioni della fluiditÃƒ , del ritmo, della velocitÃƒ  e della melodia dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢eloquio; prosodia e intonazione; menomazioni come balbuzie, farfugliamento, disritmia, bradilalia e tachilalia

Esclusioni: funzioni mentali del linguaggio (b167); funzioni della voce (b310); funzioni dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢articolazione della voce (b320)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni della fluiditÃƒ  e del ritmo dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢eloquio"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss .

ICF-:b620 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:b620,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Urination functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions of discharge of urine from the urinary bladder.
Inclusions: functions of urination, frequency of urination, urinary continence; impairments such as in stress, urge, reflex, overflow, continuous incontinence, dribbling, automatic bladder, polyuria, urinary retention and urinary urgency
Exclusions: urinary excretory functions (b610); sensations associated with urinary functions (b630)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni di scarico dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢urina dalla vescica.
Inclusioni: funzioni della minzione, frequenza della minzione, continenza urinaria; menomazioni come nellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢incontinenza da stress, da bisogno imperioso, riflessa, da sovradistensione, continua, sgocciolamento, vescica automatica, poliuria, ritenzione urinaria e urgenza minzionale

Esclusioni: funzioni urinarie escretorie (b610); sensazioni associate alle funzioni urinarie (b630)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni urinarie"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:b740 a ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:b740,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Muscle endurance functions"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions related to sustaining muscle contraction for the required period of time.
Inclusions: functions associated with sustaining muscle contraction for isolated muscles and muscle groups, and all muscles of the body; impairments such as in myasthenia gravis
Exclusions: exercise tolerance functions (b455); muscle power functions (b730); muscle tone functions (b735)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Funzioni correlate al mantenimento della contrazione muscolare per il tempo necessario.

Inclusioni: funzioni associate al mantenimento della contrazione muscolare per muscoli isolati e gruppi di muscoli, e per tutti i muscoli del corpo; menomazioni come nella miastenia grave

Esclusioni: funzioni di tolleranza dellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢esercizio fisico (b455); funzioni della forza muscolare (b730); funzioni del tono muscolare (b735)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Funzioni della resistenza muscolare"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Body_functions,
        ICF-:Spinal_Cord_Injury,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:b7602 a ICF-:b760,
        ICF-:b7602,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Coordination of voluntary movements"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Functions associated with coordination of simple and complex voluntary movements, performing movements in an orderly combination.
Inclusions: right left coordination, coordination of visually directed movements, such as eye hand coordination and eye foot coordination; impairments such as dysdiadochokinesia"""^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:b760 .

ICF-:d160 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:d160,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Focusing attention"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Intentionally focusing on specific stimuli, such as by filtering out distracting noises."@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA "Focalizzarsi intenzionalmente su stimoli specifici, come ignorare i rumori distraenti."^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Focalizzare lÃ¢â‚¬â„¢attenzione"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hearing_Loss .

ICF-:d166 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:d166,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Reading"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Performing activities involved in the comprehension and interpretation of written language (e.g. books, instructions or newspapers in text or Braille), for the purpose of obtaining general knowledge or specific information.

Exclusions: learning to read (d140)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """AttivitÃƒ  di performance coinvolte nella comprensione e nellÃ¢â‚¬â„¢interpretazione del linguaggio scritto (ad esempio libri, istruzioni o giornali in testo o in Braille), con lo scopo di acquisire conoscenze generali o informazioni specifiche.

Esclusione: imparare a leggere (d140)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Lettura"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation .

ICF-:d325 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:d325,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Communicating with - receiving - written messages"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description "Comprehending the literal and implied meanings of messages that are conveyed through written language (including Braille), such as following political events in the daily newspaper or understanding the intent of religious scripture."@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA "Comprendere il significato letterale e implicito di messaggi che vengono comunicati tramite il linguaggio scritto (incluso il Braille), come seguire gli eventi politici sui quotidiani o comprendere le intenzioni dei testi sacri."^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Comunicare con - ricevere - messaggi scritti"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke .

ICF-:d530 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:d530,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Toileting"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Planning and carrying out the elimination of human waste (menstruation, urination and defecation), and clean oneself afterwards.

Inclusions: regulating urination, defecation and menstrual care

Exclusions: washing oneself (d510); caring for body parts (d520)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Pianificare ed espletare lÃ¢â‚¬â„¢eliminazione di prodotti organici (mestruazioni, minzione e defecazione) e poi pulirsi.

Inclusioni: regolare la minzione, la defecazione e la cura relativa alle mestruazioni

Esclusioni: lavarsi (d510); prendersi cura di singole parti del corpo (d520)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Bisogni corporali"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Hand_Conditions,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

ICF-:s750 a ICF-:Body_structures,
