ICF-:d445 a ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        ICF-:d445,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care,
        owl:Class,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Hand and arm use"^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:description """Performing the coordinated actions required to move objects or to manipulate them by using hands and arms, such as when turning door handles or throwing or catching an object.

Inclusions: pulling or pushing objects; reaching; turning or twisting the hands or arms; throwing; catching

Exclusions: fine hand use (d440)"""@en ;
    ICF-:descrizioneITA """Compiere le azioni coordinate necessarie per muovere o manipolare oggetti usando mani e braccia, come nel girare le maniglie della porta o nel tirare o afferrare un oggetto.

Inclusioni: tirare o spingere oggetti; raggiungere allungando il braccio; girare o esercitare torsione delle mani o delle braccia; lanciare; afferrare

Esclusione: uso fine della mano (d440)"""^^xsd:string ;
    ICF-:nomeIta "Uso della mano e del braccio"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ICF-:Activities_and_participation,
        ICF-:Stroke,
        ICF-:Traumatic_Brain_Injury,
        ICF-:Vocational_Rehabilitation,
        Rien2:Low_Back_Pain,
        Rien2:Muskoloskeletal_Conditions_for_Post_Acute_Care .

